{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/164022-suddenly-accidentally-a-solar-dresden-codak","id":164022,"title":"Suddenly accidentally a Solar [Dresden Codak]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-09T14:44:11-07:00","id":164022,"title":"Suddenly accidentally a Solar [Dresden Codak]","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://dresdencodak.com/2014/06/09/dark-science-32/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://dresdencodak.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/DCThumbs_DarkScience_032.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://dresdencodak.com/2014/06/09/dark-science-32/\" target=\"_blank\"> Dark Science #32 - Under the Light of the Sun - Dresden Codak </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://dresdencodak.com/2014/06/09/dark-science-32/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://dresdencodak.com/2014/06/09/dark-science-32/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> &nbsp; Hey guys! For the first time, I&rsquo;m looking to expand the Dresden Codak operation to such a degree that I can more regularly put comics out and update the site in general. This means hiring one or two people to help with all the backend (ie: non-comics making part) of Dresden Codak. To that [&hellip;] </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Don't you love it when Exalts suddenly show up in your favorite things? I know I do. The latest Dresden Codak suddenly got it all: Infernals, Deathlords <i>and</i> a Solar (Dawn or Zenith, hard to be sure).<br /> <br /> This is tangentially fueling my hype for 3e, because I can't wait to do this kind of stuff in a system that doesn't make me want to pummel myself with a hammer.<br /> <br /> Other hype-fueling media are welcome as well","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\">Bearer of the legacy of Trauma Bear<br /> Need a dice-roller? Check out <a href=\"http://bit.ly/dicemat\" target=\"_blank\">Dicemat</a>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/43-fata-ku","name":"Fata-Ku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar43_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2240"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T17:44:25-07:00","id":164246,"title":"","content":"Dresden Codak is still going? I figured it dead what with the author updating once a century.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/393-godjaw","name":"Godjaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar393_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"665"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T18:06:10-07:00","id":164257,"title":"","content":"it acutlally averages to about once a month. (or did the last time I wondered and took the number of pages and divied by how long the comic had been going)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/443-redsypher","name":"RedSypher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar443_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T19:12:51-07:00","id":164299,"title":"","content":"Recent updates:<br /> <br /> June 9 2014<br /> March 27 2014<br /> December 24 2013<br /> December 2 2013<br /> October 2 2013<br /> August 23 2013<br /> July 4 2013<br /> <br /> So yeah, it might have been monthly-ish last year but it's not that frequent anymore.<br /> <br /> Personally I'm not too bothered by the update frequency, but I feel like the quality hasn't been great recently.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/797631-why-craft-sucks-how-i-fixed-it\" target=\"_blank\">EX3 Craft Rewrite</a><br /> <br /> Sanctaphrax is not a person<br /> -Chejop Kejak","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1154-sanctaphrax","name":"Sanctaphrax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1154_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T20:52:02-07:00","id":164384,"title":"","content":"I think it's telling that the Dark Science storyline started back in 2010.<br /> <br /> And it only recently updated installment 32.<br /> <br /> That averages out to about 8 posts a year... Which is what, one post ever 1.67 months?<br /> <br /> I mean the art is really nice, but the story is just bizarre. I have no idea what's going on, and the updates don't come frequently enough to maintain engagement.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}